s.\r\n\r\nI created a small GDExtension project just to test these methods, and built it against godotengine/godot-cpp@4.4\r\nI confirmed it appears to work correctly when run both with godot.exe from 4.5-beta1 as well as with a build from this PR branch.\r\nHere's my test code: https://github.com/simpkins/gdextension_test/blob/1a962861e684a84d7f8cbed35e3d34c309ff2afe/src/gdexample.cpp\r\n\r\nLet me know if that covers the cases you are concerned about, or if I should be testing something else.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005765335/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3006614008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107952#issuecomment-3006614008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107952","id":3006614008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6zNUn4","user":{"login":"simpkins","id":163549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzU0OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins","html_url":"https://github.com/simpkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site